      "instance_name": "martin_luther_king_jr",
      "label": "Martin Luther King Jr.",
      "description": "The individual commemorated on Martin Luther King Day, a national holiday in the United States honoring his life, legacy, and contributions to the civil rights movement. His work focused on nonviolent resistance and the fight for racial equality and justice, making the holiday a solemn and significant observance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
