      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme trivializes Martin Luther King Day by juxtaposing a solemn national observance with a childish visual metaphor (flowers in an ice cream cone), potentially diminishing the gravity of Dr. King's contributions and the ongoing struggle for racial justice. This can be seen as culturally harmful.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_321eafda"
      },
